# Inventory Stock Level Audit Dashboard

## About the Project

This is an Inventory Stock Level Audit Dashboard created in Microsoft Excel.

The dashboard helps analyze inventory data by showing stock value, warehouse performance, product details, and stock status in a simple and visual way.

## Features

- Total Inventory Value
- Warehouse-wise Inventory Analysis
- Category-wise Inventory Analysis
- Stock Status Tracking
- Top Products by Inventory Value
- Charts and Visual Reports

## Tools Used

- Microsoft Excel
- Pivot Tables
- Pivot Charts
- Slicers
- Conditional Formatting

